WEBVTT

00:02.170 --> 00:03.930
Annette.

00:03.930 --> 00:05.830
I'm hungry.

00:05.440 --> 00:07.150
<b>m 0 0 l 85 0 85 115 0 115</b>

00:05.440 --> 00:07.150
<b>Tama (Temp)

Lv. 15
 Skills
Cat Punch
Cat Kick
Wildcat Strike</b>

00:07.240 --> 00:09.650
<b>m 0 0 l 70 0 70 115 0 115</b>

00:07.240 --> 00:09.650
<b>Annette

Lv. 19
 Skills
 Cure
 Detox
 Shield</b>

00:07.350 --> 00:08.920
Me, too.

00:09.880 --> 00:12.010
Why don't we take a break?

00:13.110 --> 00:15.080
Ugh, I'm beat.

00:18.120 --> 00:20.590
Is it time to eat?

00:20.710 --> 00:22.290
<b>Sensei

Lv. 3
 Skills
 None
 Status
 Poisoned</b>

00:22.720 --> 00:25.390
Here, Sensei. Have some bread.

00:26.190 --> 00:28.250
Do you have any boiled tofu?

00:28.250 --> 00:29.760
Boiled tofu?

00:32.640 --> 00:36.820
Boiled tofu! Let's look 
for some in the next town.

00:36.820 --> 00:38.570
<i>Such an indomitable spirit...</i>

02:00.930 --> 02:04.430
<b>No Longer Allowed               in Another World</b>

02:04.430 --> 02:05.730
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

02:05.730 --> 02:08.980
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

02:09.960 --> 02:12.950
How much farther to my place?

02:13.220 --> 02:15.960
Your hometown is Grün, isn't it?

02:15.960 --> 02:18.330
We should arrive within a few days.

02:18.330 --> 02:23.150
But first, please allow us to 
make a stop at Zweiten Temple.

02:23.150 --> 02:25.030
Sure, but why?

02:26.740 --> 02:31.690
Normally, Other Worlders arrive at 
one of four temples in our world

02:31.690 --> 02:34.900
and depart for the Dark 
Lord's castle from there.

02:34.900 --> 02:40.090
However, Sensei's goal is not to defeat 
the Dark Lord, but to find "Sacchan."

02:40.090 --> 02:45.300
So we must visit the four 
temples to gather information.

02:45.300 --> 02:50.080
What? You mean if we're unlucky, we might 
have to travel all around the world?

02:50.080 --> 02:51.010
Yes.

02:51.290 --> 02:52.850
Is there a problem?

02:52.850 --> 02:55.350
You're really crazy, you know that?

02:55.350 --> 03:02.570
To be honest, I don't want 
Sensei to fight the Dark Lord.

03:02.880 --> 03:05.270
I don't want him to put himself in danger.

03:05.540 --> 03:11.240
I'm not much of a guide 
for Other Worlders, am I?

03:11.510 --> 03:13.310
Annette...

03:13.310 --> 03:17.060
You must really love Sensei.

03:17.380 --> 03:19.600
N-N-No!

03:21.270 --> 03:27.560
Sensei showed me the light when 
I'd given up hope for my job.

03:27.920 --> 03:32.200
This time, it's my turn to help him.

03:32.200 --> 03:36.520
But what if this "Sacchan" is his lover?

03:37.770 --> 03:41.640
I'm also going with him to verify that.

03:41.640 --> 03:43.230
<i>Such an indomitable spirit...</i>

03:43.900 --> 03:48.040
Fine. In that case, I'll go with you.

03:48.040 --> 03:50.380
But only until we reach my hometown.

03:50.660 --> 03:54.260
Uh, okay... Thank you.

03:54.260 --> 03:56.240
You'd rather be alone with him?

03:56.770 --> 04:00.110
More importantly, will you 
be allowed into the temple?

04:00.110 --> 04:02.330
Didn't you ditch your 
previous job to come here?

04:02.710 --> 04:04.290
Don't worry.

04:04.760 --> 04:08.510
The head priest of Zweiten Temple 
is a dear friend of mine.

04:08.510 --> 04:11.330
Besides, I didn't leave 
my post without notice.

04:11.330 --> 04:14.470
I had my familiar deliver my resignation.

04:14.960 --> 04:17.680
By "familiar," do you mean that thing?

04:17.990 --> 04:22.150
Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch...

04:19.860 --> 04:22.150
Yes, that thing!

04:22.520 --> 04:26.070
Sheesh! Why are you always 
causing mischief?

04:26.740 --> 04:30.790
What about my resignation? 
You delivered my resignation, didn't you?

04:36.070 --> 04:38.830
You didn't even perform 
that important task...

04:38.830 --> 04:41.540
So why did you come back here?!

04:45.170 --> 04:50.010
You dutifully returned to your dear master.

04:50.710 --> 04:53.980
But your master is furious with you.

04:55.090 --> 04:57.280
I've got it.

04:57.820 --> 04:59.990
Your name is Melos.

05:02.090 --> 05:04.420
Looks like he likes you, Sensei.

05:07.770 --> 05:09.290
What a bother.

05:09.870 --> 05:12.330
I left my post without notice...

05:12.330 --> 05:15.320
Gods, forgive me...

05:15.320 --> 05:17.030
Hey, you! Quit fretting!

05:23.750 --> 05:26.430
Quiet, Melos.

05:26.920 --> 05:29.170
Hey! Where are you going?

05:32.420 --> 05:33.600
Wh-What was that?

05:44.870 --> 05:48.380
A dragon... The world's most powerful monster...

05:48.380 --> 05:50.490
What is it doing here?

05:58.400 --> 06:00.340
Ryuka, stop.

06:10.670 --> 06:12.090
Watch out!

06:17.640 --> 06:21.860
Cohaden. Leisaidah, ahadulca.

06:32.770 --> 06:34.900
Y-You're kidding, right?

06:34.900 --> 06:37.250
She tamed the dragon.

06:37.250 --> 06:39.820
Wh-Who are you?

06:41.230 --> 06:43.700
There are many monsters in this area.

06:43.700 --> 06:45.430
You should leave quickly.

06:46.100 --> 06:48.930
It looks like you've already 
suffered casualties.

06:48.930 --> 06:51.230
Oh... Actually, he's...

06:52.170 --> 06:53.420
Is it time to eat?

06:53.420 --> 06:56.040
Sorry for scaring you.

06:56.040 --> 06:58.430
He's a bit of an eccentric Other Worlder.

07:01.440 --> 07:02.850
An Other Worlder?

07:06.510 --> 07:07.970
I'll kill you.

07:08.570 --> 07:11.870
I'll kill all Other Worlders.

07:14.800 --> 07:17.590
Wh-What is this power?!

07:21.990 --> 07:23.170
Crap!

07:23.170 --> 07:25.010
Stout barrier of light...

07:26.210 --> 07:27.760
Shield!

07:48.410 --> 07:53.370
Y-You're kidding, right? 
Her magic is insanely powerful.

07:54.410 --> 07:56.450
Can you stand, Tama?

07:58.740 --> 08:02.120
We must protect Sensei, no matter what.

08:04.950 --> 08:06.770
What is this?

08:06.770 --> 08:09.040
I can't move...

08:14.110 --> 08:16.710
C-Could it be...

08:17.450 --> 08:19.690
That mark...

08:21.060 --> 08:23.110
The Wrathful Dark Lord!

08:30.880 --> 08:32.310
Good grief.

08:33.140 --> 08:35.780
Enough of this dangerous behavior.

08:36.670 --> 08:40.000
Your business is with 
Other Worlders, is it not?

08:40.520 --> 08:45.590
Then these two have nothing to do with this.

08:47.040 --> 08:49.670
Get a good look.

08:50.580 --> 08:54.390
I am your opponent.

08:54.940 --> 08:57.840
Now do as you please.

08:58.850 --> 09:02.400
I'm ready to die anytime.

09:01.500 --> 09:03.280
Sensei, no!

09:03.280 --> 09:04.260
I see.

09:04.780 --> 09:05.930
In that case...

09:06.300 --> 09:07.220
Die.

09:21.050 --> 09:23.590
My name is Waldelia.

09:24.400 --> 09:28.030
Rest in peace, Other Worlder.

09:33.070 --> 09:34.590
No...

09:39.600 --> 09:41.430
You stabbed me.

09:43.350 --> 09:45.100
I can tell.

09:45.520 --> 09:48.800
You possess a powerful hatred.

09:50.300 --> 09:55.020
I once wanted to stab someone, too.

09:55.510 --> 10:01.240
I went as far as sending 
them a threatening letter.

10:02.740 --> 10:04.960
What are you talking about?

10:05.800 --> 10:11.420
At that time, I had lost my 
mind to intense hatred.

10:12.400 --> 10:15.170
Isn't that what's happening to you now?

10:16.290 --> 10:21.220
After all, your eyes look sad.

10:22.090 --> 10:27.570
Will you tell me why, miss?

10:28.890 --> 10:29.790
Ryuka!

10:39.700 --> 10:40.880
<i>What was that?</i>

10:46.150 --> 10:49.170
<i>Who is that man?</i>

10:54.340 --> 10:58.230
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:54.850 --> 10:58.230
I'm Ready to 
Die Anytime

10:58.230 --> 10:59.060
I'm Ready to 
Die Anytime

10:58.230 --> 10:59.100
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:59.060 --> 10:59.100
I'm Ready to 
Die Anytime

10:59.100 --> 10:59.140
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:59.100 --> 10:59.140
I'm Ready to 
Die Anytime

10:59.150 --> 10:59.190
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:59.190 --> 10:59.270
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:59.270 --> 10:59.310
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:01.970 --> 11:04.180
<b><b>Donnerstag Region</b></b>

11:04.220 --> 11:05.640
<b><b>Zweiten Temple</b></b>

11:15.620 --> 11:16.910
Is that you, Annette?

11:17.790 --> 11:18.910
Annette!

11:19.540 --> 11:21.750
Hang in there, Annette!

11:22.220 --> 11:26.360
Don't worry about me. Help him.

11:31.020 --> 11:33.210
Bring every healing potion we have!

11:33.210 --> 11:35.170
Summon every priest present!

11:44.630 --> 11:47.420
You've got a good eye, sir.

11:47.420 --> 11:49.110
That's a bottle of poison.

11:49.110 --> 11:53.200
Throw it at a monster, and it'll 
instantly be afflicted with a powerful—

11:53.780 --> 11:58.290
Hey! Why would you do that after 
you just made a miraculous recovery?!

11:59.070 --> 12:02.780
I recovered so much, I felt unwell.

12:04.250 --> 12:06.370
Stop drinking that!

12:06.370 --> 12:09.220
H-He seems to have made 
a complete recovery.

12:09.220 --> 12:11.440
Yes, thanks to you.

12:11.860 --> 12:14.940
Thank you so much for your help, Ysha.

12:14.940 --> 12:17.260
I swear I'll repay you somehow.

12:17.260 --> 12:18.500
Of course you will.

12:18.820 --> 12:23.760
Oh, right. Ysha, do you know an 
Other Worlder named Sacchan?

12:23.760 --> 12:27.520
No, never heard of her. 
She hasn't been to our temple.

12:27.520 --> 12:30.890
I see. Where could she be?

12:30.890 --> 12:32.890
More importantly, Annette...

12:33.500 --> 12:36.900
Why are you traveling with an Other Worlder?

12:36.900 --> 12:38.020
Huh?

12:38.020 --> 12:41.790
I was shocked when I heard you 
had quit your job without notice,

12:41.790 --> 12:44.200
but I was also relieved.

12:44.640 --> 12:49.610
I had a feeling you were 
too pure for this job.

12:49.990 --> 12:50.830
However!

12:51.190 --> 12:54.120
Now you're traveling with an 
Other Worlder of all things?

12:54.120 --> 12:55.290
Ysha...

12:55.580 --> 13:01.220
You know there's no such thing as 
a decent Other Worlder, Annette.

13:01.220 --> 13:02.950
W-Well...

13:02.950 --> 13:08.230
They're given divine powers known 
as Gifts to defeat the Dark Lord,

13:08.230 --> 13:11.940
yet they all call them 
"overpowered skills" and use them

13:11.940 --> 13:13.650
for their own self-interest—

13:12.850 --> 13:13.650
What's this?

13:14.130 --> 13:17.030
Are you two elf ladies fighting?

13:17.430 --> 13:19.730
Wipe those scowls off your faces

13:20.320 --> 13:23.860
and have some fun with 
Kotaro the Other Worlder.

13:24.310 --> 13:28.040
In any case, stop traveling 
with him, Annette.

13:28.040 --> 13:29.480
B-But, Ysha...

13:29.750 --> 13:33.200
My overpowered skill is "Mass Production"!

13:33.200 --> 13:35.830
<b>Infinitely Multiplying Currency</b>

13:33.550 --> 13:37.710
I can produce an unlimited amount 
of this world's currency!

13:37.710 --> 13:40.050
See? Isn't it dazzling?

13:40.050 --> 13:43.420
Kotaro will buy you whatever you want.

13:44.050 --> 13:45.700
We're having a conversation here!

13:44.870 --> 13:47.060
My eyes! M-M-My eyes!

13:47.060 --> 13:49.540
You'll pay for this, ladies!

13:49.540 --> 13:52.520
See? They're all like that.

13:52.520 --> 13:56.560
B-But, Ysha, Sensei is not like 
the other Other Worlders.

13:56.560 --> 13:58.160
No, he is.

13:58.160 --> 13:59.680
I can tell just by looking at his face.

14:00.140 --> 14:02.150
That's the face of a destructive person.

14:02.400 --> 14:05.770
He'll ruin you if you stay with him.

14:06.440 --> 14:10.820
If not for Sensei, I wouldn't be who I am now.

14:10.820 --> 14:14.540
Sensei changed my fate.

14:14.540 --> 14:16.550
Annette-kun, Annette-kun.

14:18.310 --> 14:20.630
There's this drug I'd like to buy.

14:20.630 --> 14:23.780
And he's not destructive at all.

14:23.880 --> 14:28.090
Giving           Money Without Looking

14:24.580 --> 14:28.100
No, he's already ruined you...

14:29.860 --> 14:30.900
So?

14:31.550 --> 14:34.500
What Gift does that Other Worlder possess?

14:34.900 --> 14:38.370
Well, your party was easily defeated.

14:38.370 --> 14:40.470
His ability must not be very impressive.

14:40.780 --> 14:43.350
Sensei doesn't have an ability.

14:43.350 --> 14:45.370
What? He doesn't have a Gift?

14:45.800 --> 14:53.630
Despite that, he risked his own life against 
the Wrathful Dark Lord to protect us.

14:54.130 --> 14:55.440
Hold on.

14:55.440 --> 14:58.410
What are you talking about?

14:58.860 --> 15:03.620
The Wrathful Dark Lord was destroyed by 
another Other Worlder seven days ago.

15:04.260 --> 15:05.510
What?

15:14.770 --> 15:16.250
Calm down.

15:16.760 --> 15:20.240
No matter how much you bark, 
your master won't return.

15:21.110 --> 15:24.180
We've already dealt with them.

15:26.580 --> 15:27.780
Father...

15:32.340 --> 15:33.830
What?!

15:33.830 --> 15:36.410
The Wrathful Dark Lord was destroyed?!

15:36.650 --> 15:40.760
Ysha received a message from 
church headquarters yesterday.

15:40.760 --> 15:44.130
The Dark Lord was defeated by 
an Other Worlder seven days ago.

15:44.420 --> 15:48.570
Tama, peace has finally come to Zauberberg!

15:48.570 --> 15:51.660
All right! Thank you, Other Worlder!

15:52.780 --> 15:54.150
Wait a minute.

15:54.870 --> 15:58.460
If that's true, then who was that?

15:58.460 --> 16:00.400
That is the question, indeed...

16:00.400 --> 16:04.740
And didn't Sensei show up seven days ago?

16:04.740 --> 16:09.210
Yes, I'll never forget it. 
That day changed my life.

16:09.210 --> 16:10.870
That's not what I meant.

16:10.870 --> 16:15.440
If that's true, then why did 
Sensei come to this world?

16:15.440 --> 16:18.450
If this world no longer has a Dark Lord...

16:27.670 --> 16:28.960
Perhaps I'll die.

16:30.390 --> 16:36.450
"Here lies a man who spent his life 
tearing up pages of his slips of the pen."

16:36.840 --> 16:39.840
Engrave that on my tombstone.

16:39.840 --> 16:41.820
What happened to you?

16:44.260 --> 16:47.660
I simply thought I'd try 
writing about the events

16:47.660 --> 16:50.900
that have occurred since 
I came to this world.

16:51.560 --> 16:57.620
But I'm struggling to write, 
and now I'm despairing over that.

16:57.990 --> 17:00.970
Oh! You're recording our travels, Sensei?

17:00.970 --> 17:04.590
How did you describe our meeting?

17:05.140 --> 17:08.120
I didn't write anything about you.

17:10.130 --> 17:11.740
Nothing?

17:11.740 --> 17:13.320
I wonder why.

17:13.320 --> 17:19.300
When I met Waldelia-kun, 
I felt a strange surge of creativity.

17:20.000 --> 17:26.650
I pray something else that excites
my sensitivities will occur.

17:27.470 --> 17:30.020
I'm not doing anything dangerous again.

17:30.390 --> 17:33.150
Then why don't we go out 
on the town to relax?

17:33.530 --> 17:38.280
Considering our future, there are a few 
things I'd like to buy for you, Sensei.

17:39.350 --> 17:41.020
Thank you!

17:40.370 --> 17:42.240
<b>m 0 0 l 105 0 105 35 0 35</b>

17:40.370 --> 17:42.240
<b>Sensei equipped
Silver Armor</b>

17:41.020 --> 17:42.550
Wait, wait, wait!

17:42.550 --> 17:43.950
That's for heavily armed fighters!

17:43.950 --> 17:47.270
Yes, it even deflects novice-level spells.

17:47.270 --> 17:50.740
There's no telling when we'll 
be attacked, or by whom.

17:51.060 --> 17:54.520
I don't want to see Sensei suffer anymore.

17:54.520 --> 17:56.500
He looks like he's suffering right now.

17:57.160 --> 18:00.580
This oppressive feeling... isn't bad.

18:00.580 --> 18:01.840
You <i>like</i> it?

18:02.130 --> 18:04.730
We're going shopping.

18:04.730 --> 18:07.000
Don't go anywhere without us, okay?

18:07.000 --> 18:08.050
Yeah, I wouldn't count on that.

18:13.780 --> 18:15.320
What's this thing?

18:15.320 --> 18:16.530
It's so big.

18:16.530 --> 18:17.740
Is something the matter?

18:17.740 --> 18:18.890
What is it?

18:18.890 --> 18:19.610
What're you doing?

18:19.610 --> 18:20.210
Hello.

18:21.980 --> 18:25.370
You're Ysha-kun, correct?

18:25.370 --> 18:27.750
What are you doing, Other Worlder?

18:28.890 --> 18:32.290
I was just seeking new excitement.

18:32.290 --> 18:34.040
I-I see.

18:34.970 --> 18:38.970
No matter. I wanted to 
speak with you anyway.

18:38.970 --> 18:43.440
Listen to me, Other Worlder. From now on, 
Annette will be staying with me.

18:44.910 --> 18:47.900
She's always been a very pure girl.

18:47.900 --> 18:51.650
It makes her trust people too easily.

18:51.650 --> 18:56.330
But being with an Other Worlder 
will definitely make her unhappy.

18:56.690 --> 19:00.230
As her friend, I must step in.

19:00.730 --> 19:04.950
So please, dissolve your party with Annette!

19:04.960 --> 19:06.960
<b>Remove Annette 
from party?

Yes

No</b>

19:06.960 --> 19:10.210
<b>Remove Annette 
from party?

No

Grin</b>

19:08.880 --> 19:10.210
Say something!

19:10.900 --> 19:16.570
It's for Annette-kun to decide if 
she wants to come with me or not.

19:16.570 --> 19:19.660
You have no say in the matter.

19:19.660 --> 19:21.060
Wh-What?

19:21.570 --> 19:25.780
She's not a bird in a cage.

19:28.170 --> 19:32.980
And how can you be so certain 
Annette-kun will be unhappy?

19:32.980 --> 19:35.610
Because you're an Other Worlder!

19:36.190 --> 19:37.590
Let me be clear!

19:37.590 --> 19:41.380
I don't trust you Other Worlders at all!

19:50.380 --> 19:51.620
What's going on?

19:51.920 --> 19:53.330
That's...

19:53.330 --> 19:55.760
Behold, everyone.

19:55.760 --> 20:00.300
This man was created by the 
heavens to stand above us.

20:00.590 --> 20:03.140
Lord Suzuki the Other Worlder!

20:03.390 --> 20:05.860
People of Veil, listen to me.

20:05.860 --> 20:07.980
I have something to tell you.

20:08.270 --> 20:14.060
The other day, the Wrathful Dark Lord was 
defeated by a group of Other Worlders!

20:14.060 --> 20:14.850
What?

20:14.850 --> 20:16.380
The Dark Lord is dead?

20:16.380 --> 20:20.910
Rejoice! Peace has come to your world!

20:21.800 --> 20:23.260
Is that true?

20:23.260 --> 20:25.360
They finally did it!

20:26.860 --> 20:29.830
Praise Other Worlders!

20:33.850 --> 20:37.010
Now, let's get to the point.

20:37.260 --> 20:40.780
Who granted you your peace?

20:40.780 --> 20:47.010
None other than the Other Worlders 
who risked their lives fighting!

20:47.420 --> 20:53.850
Thus begins a new age ruled 
by us Other Worlders!

20:55.810 --> 21:00.020
It shall be known as the Great Hero Age!

21:00.020 --> 21:06.000
And the town of Veil will 
be ruled by Suzuki-san.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.750
B-But...

21:07.750 --> 21:09.380
What's going on?

21:09.380 --> 21:12.920
If you understand, then kneel, fools.

21:12.920 --> 21:16.850
The Great Hero Age? 
Who does he think he is?

21:17.660 --> 21:19.680
Suzuki-san, that's her!

21:19.960 --> 21:22.180
That's the elf who committed 
violence against me!

21:22.180 --> 21:25.480
That's her!

21:25.480 --> 21:28.170
You committed violence 
against an Other Worlder?

21:28.170 --> 21:30.020
Th-This is a misunderstanding.

21:30.020 --> 21:31.800
We didn't commit any violence.

21:31.800 --> 21:36.280
How dare you commit violence against 
a hero who saved Zauberberg?

21:36.800 --> 21:38.470
Such a bad girl.

21:44.530 --> 21:46.440
Be a good girl.

23:32.100 --> 23:33.900
I finally...

23:34.850 --> 23:38.500
felt like I could write my masterpiece.
